{"3519070": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Overdawn", "steam_appid": 3519070, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overdawn</strong> is a fast-paced, bullet-time, bullet-hell shooter set in a world on the brink of collapse. Play as one of the Chosen Ones—sent into the past to stop the fall of Andrean. Fight through waves of enemies with razor-sharp gunplay, uncover buried truths, and explore a stunning 2.5D world brought to life with style and atmosphere.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylized 2.5D pixel-voxel art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced, precision gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stealth mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique character abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story campaign where your choices shape the path</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visually striking world</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BULLET TIME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519070/extras/c0f8617397fd03b88fd82aadd3654e0e.poster.avif?t=1772515062\" width=1170 height=373 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519070/extras/c0f8617397fd03b88fd82aadd3654e0e.webm?t=1772515062\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge through storms of enemy fire while slowing time to land the perfect headshot. Precision isn’t a luxury—it’s survival.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE CRITICAL EDGE</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519070/extras/23d8609b91d9d01bf5f010237703af20.poster.avif?t=1772515062\" width=1170 height=373 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519070/extras/23d8609b91d9d01bf5f010237703af20.webm?t=1772515062\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Success is measured in milliseconds and millimeters. From the trajectory of your dash to the headshot you line up in slow motion, every action is governed by pinpoint precision. Mastery over your movement and aim is the only path to survival.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A STYLISH DYSTOPIA</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519070/extras/c003fc0221d5725d0c3d6ae0c188e03f.poster.avif?t=1772515062\" width=1170 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519070/extras/c003fc0221d5725d0c3d6ae0c188e03f.webm?t=1772515062\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519070/extras/c003fc0221d5725d0c3d6ae0c188e03f.mp4?t=1772515062\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a unique 2.5D world filled with dramatic set pieces and stylish visuals. From a war-torn city to an ethereal garden, every environment pulls you deeper into the fall of Andrean—stylized, immersive, and made to move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CONVERSATIONS MATTER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519070/extras/97f29c1e4d0e69016bd62c0076758f0c.poster.avif?t=1772515062\" width=1170 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519070/extras/97f29c1e4d0e69016bd62c0076758f0c.webm?t=1772515062\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519070/extras/97f29c1e4d0e69016bd62c0076758f0c.mp4?t=1772515062\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into dynamic conversations where every word matters. Dialogue shapes your path as you uncover the truth behind Andrean’s downfall. Text comes to life with emotion as you connect with allies, confront enemies, and push forward to the very end. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SKILL TREE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519070/extras/70eb2e48e1c9e3d82880c736a31aab61.poster.avif?t=1772515062\" width=1170 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519070/extras/70eb2e48e1c9e3d82880c736a31aab61.webm?t=1772515062\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519070/extras/70eb2e48e1c9e3d82880c736a31aab61.mp4?t=1772515062\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acquire and develop a broad set of skills to become the precise tool needed to rewrite history. Each upgrade brings you closer to changing the apocalyptic future and mastering the art of the perfect kill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We’re a small indie team with a big love for games—and <strong>Overdawn</strong> is the game we’ve always wanted to make.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Youngje</strong> began development in Unity over two years ago, and since then, he and the current team have expanded and refined it. From late-night bug fixes to hand-crafting every scene, we’ve poured our hearts into this project.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s been a wild ride, and we’re so excited to finally share it with you.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519070/extras/2591cf18c65481850f7bcf27bbcb2791.avif?t=1772515062\" width=899 height=568 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overdawn</strong> is a fast-paced, bullet-time, bullet-hell shooter set in a world on the brink of collapse. Play as one of the Chosen Ones—sent into the past to stop the fall of Andrean. Fight through waves of enemies with razor-sharp gunplay, uncover buried truths, and explore a stunning 2.5D world brought to life with style and atmosphere.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylized 2.5D pixel-voxel art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced, precision gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stealth mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique character abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story campaign where your choices shape the path</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visually striking world</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BULLET TIME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519070/extras/c0f8617397fd03b88fd82aadd3654e0e.poster.avif?t=1772515062\" width=1170 height=373 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519070/extras/c0f8617397fd03b88fd82aadd3654e0e.webm?t=1772515062\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge through storms of enemy fire while slowing time to land the perfect headshot. Precision isn’t a luxury—it’s survival.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE CRITICAL EDGE</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519070/extras/23d8609b91d9d01bf5f010237703af20.poster.avif?t=1772515062\" width=1170 height=373 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519070/extras/23d8609b91d9d01bf5f010237703af20.webm?t=1772515062\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Success is measured in milliseconds and millimeters. From the trajectory of your dash to the headshot you line up in slow motion, every action is governed by pinpoint precision. Mastery over your movement and aim is the only path to survival.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A STYLISH DYSTOPIA</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519070/extras/c003fc0221d5725d0c3d6ae0c188e03f.poster.avif?t=1772515062\" width=1170 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519070/extras/c003fc0221d5725d0c3d6ae0c188e03f.webm?t=1772515062\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519070/extras/c003fc0221d5725d0c3d6ae0c188e03f.mp4?t=1772515062\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a unique 2.5D world filled with dramatic set pieces and stylish visuals. From a war-torn city to an ethereal garden, every environment pulls you deeper into the fall of Andrean—stylized, immersive, and made to move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CONVERSATIONS MATTER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519070/extras/97f29c1e4d0e69016bd62c0076758f0c.poster.avif?t=1772515062\" width=1170 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519070/extras/97f29c1e4d0e69016bd62c0076758f0c.webm?t=1772515062\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519070/extras/97f29c1e4d0e69016bd62c0076758f0c.mp4?t=1772515062\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into dynamic conversations where every word matters. Dialogue shapes your path as you uncover the truth behind Andrean’s downfall. Text comes to life with emotion as you connect with allies, confront enemies, and push forward to the very end. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SKILL TREE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519070/extras/70eb2e48e1c9e3d82880c736a31aab61.poster.avif?t=1772515062\" width=1170 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519070/extras/70eb2e48e1c9e3d82880c736a31aab61.webm?t=1772515062\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519070/extras/70eb2e48e1c9e3d82880c736a31aab61.mp4?t=1772515062\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acquire and develop a broad set of skills to become the precise tool needed to rewrite history. Each upgrade brings you closer to changing the apocalyptic future and mastering the art of the perfect kill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We’re a small indie team with a big love for games—and <strong>Overdawn</strong> is the game we’ve always wanted to make.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Youngje</strong> began development in Unity over two years ago, and since then, he and the current team have expanded and refined it. From late-night bug fixes to hand-crafting every scene, we’ve poured our hearts into this project.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s been a wild ride, and we’re so excited to finally share it with you.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519070/extras/2591cf18c65481850f7bcf27bbcb2791.avif?t=1772515062\" width=899 height=568 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Overdawn is a 2.5D, bullet time shooter set in a dystopian city of Andrean. As a blood-thirsty merc, hunt down your enemies and defy against your destiny. Now—lock in. Slow time and find your flow state. Punch a hole in your enemy’s head—because it’s you or them.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519070/bb8cc5492e8a415578354c8926820d2abfafafb8/header.jpg?t=1772515062", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519070/1cd0de8516025a2e5506bc3bb65afeb7c1148e17/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772515062", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519070/1cd0de8516025a2e5506bc3bb65afeb7c1148e17/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772515062", "website": "https://linktr.ee/overdawn", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core 2 Duo E6320 (2*1866) or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2  GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce 7600 GS (512 MB) or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mac OS X 10.12+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual core from Intel or AMD at 2.8 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia 450 GTS or better<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Youngje Park"], "publishers": ["Overdawn Studio"], "demos": [{"appid": 3988240, "description": ""}], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": true, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "1", "description": "Action"}, {"id": "25", "description": "Adventure"}, {"id": "23", "description": "Indie"}, {"id": "3", "description": "RPG"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519070/f7b6e6e6bd17e1873db18800d8f0042ce1bdbe8f/ss_f7b6e6e6bd17e1873db18800d8f0042ce1bdbe8f.600x338.jpg?t=1772515062", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519070/f7b6e6e6bd17e1873db18800d8f0042ce1bdbe8f/ss_f7b6e6e6bd17e1873db18800d8f0042ce1bdbe8f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772515062"}, {"id": 1, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519070/ee3c870d6021d2f1f5050f94edd0ea536187a0c2/ss_ee3c870d6021d2f1f5050f94edd0ea536187a0c2.600x338.jpg?t=1772515062", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519070/ee3c870d6021d2f1f5050f94edd0ea536187a0c2/ss_ee3c870d6021d2f1f5050f94edd0ea536187a0c2.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772515062"}, {"id": 2, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519070/c2b9a64bc75e1f8d0318b25d49c8835c1d447067/ss_c2b9a64bc75e1f8d0318b25d49c8835c1d447067.600x338.jpg?t=1772515062", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519070/c2b9a64bc75e1f